   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**어제** = ayer. **지난주** = la semana pasada. **지난 주말** = el fin de semana pasado.",
     "@en": "**어제** = yesterday. **지난주** = last week. **지난 주말** = last weekend."
    },
    {
     "@es": "**일찍** = temprano. **늦게** = tarde.",
     "@en": "**일찍** = early. **늦게** = late."
    },
    {
     "@es": "**재미있어요** = es divertido, es interesante. En pasado: **재미있었어요**.",
     "@en": "**재미있어요** = is fun, it's interesting. In the past: **재미있었어요**."
    }
